      },
      "parentId": "page:rzZiePRRfcB3TrrCNiMbE",
      "index": "a342z",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:SdkuWQNIXi_d0o8aqyAf4": {
      "x": 37.05019031872757,
      "y": 42.94096272159703,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:SdkuWQNIXi_d0o8aqyAf4",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "stance",
        "text": "I keep hearing the same metaphor, offered as though it were simply how things are: attention is a resource, spent like currency, and the discipline of a life is mostly a discipline of budgeting it.",
        "sourceId": "001-received-view",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 1
      },
      "parentId": "shape:NrfEUK3ihwKQcQ7AYYYqI",
      "index": "a1",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:n5BLJQPhQrMMM7C-xE-qo": {
      "x": 392,
      "y": 24,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:n5BLJQPhQrMMM7C-xE-qo",
      "type": "atom",
      "parentId": "shape:qSBVHYUr_ji9QkO3ClHZd",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "claim",
        "text": "Attention is not spent. It is fed.",
        "sourceId": "m-002",
        "created": "2026-07-31",
        "ordinal": 2
      },
      "index": "a2vl2",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "binding:S0fZv_NW-FFROF5dK7FM7": {
      "meta": {},
      "id": "binding:S0fZv_NW-FFROF5dK7FM7",
      "type": "arrow",
      "fromId": "shape:WU_bBTQIju5CXwp6oZf7H",
      "toId": "shape:tJzGP1TYLRoG6ifY_Kf2e",
      "props": {
        "isPrecise": false,
        "isExact": false,
        "normalizedAnchor": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "snap": "none",
        "terminal": "start"
      },
      "typeName": "binding"
    },
    "shape:6ywKw1_wwV1slSL97C46G": {
      "x": 760,
      "y": 48,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:6ywKw1_wwV1slSL97C46G",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "untyped",
        "text": "The attention economy names something real: that noticing costs, that a mind spread thin produces thin noticing, and that no one attends to everything at once. This much I want to hold onto, even as I argue against the metaphor built on top of it.",
        "sourceId": "003-ground-the-economy",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 3
      },
      "parentId": "shape:NrfEUK3ihwKQcQ7AYYYqI",
      "index": "a3Ugw",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:siDjmgM9Apm9WhjSPxXKM": {
      "x": 24,
      "y": 520,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:siDjmgM9Apm9WhjSPxXKM",
      "type": "gap",
      "parentId": "shape:m_JQs1vh7ev7ZFEm4X4p1",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "label": "Focus is a muscle, and the remedy for weakness is repetition.",
        "facingId": "shape:c8znXl8aD82hkYysJ8gCW",
        "sourceId": "g-r-005"
      },
      "index": "aBpsA",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "binding:xG6lbV8VRzJP3jxpwFGRE": {
      "meta": {},
      "id": "binding:xG6lbV8VRzJP3jxpwFGRE",
      "type": "arrow",
      "fromId": "shape:DACF-SN196Abk8D_i1RYw",
      "toId": "shape:1pPTBL6tHJIjbps9q9Zub",
      "props": {
        "isPrecise": false,
        "isExact": false,
        "normalizedAnchor": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "snap": "none",
        "terminal": "end"
      },
      "typeName": "binding"
    },
    "shape:nVvqKlxN4TRfGTwAtnu0v": {
      "x": 24,
      "y": 768,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:nVvqKlxN4TRfGTwAtnu0v",
      "type": "atom",
      "parentId": "shape:m_JQs1vh7ev7ZFEm4X4p1",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "stance",
        "text": "The scarce good is time, and attention is how time is spent.",
        "sourceId": "r-007",
        "created": "2026-07-31",
        "ordinal": 7
      },
      "index": "a7JeX",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:-pbRkVShnaPD5EIWrglmj": {
      "x": 760,
      "y": 296,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:-pbRkVShnaPD5EIWrglmj",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "untyped",
        "text": "Under the metabolic view, rest still matters, but so does what gets carried in: the discipline is not withdrawal but composition, the slow work of choosing a diet of claims and figures and long clausal sentences the mind can actually break down, hold, and eventually turn into something of its own—which is, I think, the only definition of understanding I still trust, and the only reason I keep writing sentences this long instead of shorter ones that would spend less and carry less as well.",
        "sourceId": "012-a-diet-a-practice-can-hold",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 12
      },
      "parentId": "shape:OrypP3apbvLqca33-xLSd",
      "index": "a6hSX",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:GE9tKRRi9zwqN5e6gCdFe": {
      "x": 405.0501903187276,
      "y": 42.94096272159703,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:GE9tKRRi9zwqN5e6gCdFe",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "claim",
        "text": "Pay attention, we say, as if the paying settled something—as if the mind kept a ledger, and the ledger, once emptied, simply closed for the day.",
        "sourceId": "002-pay-attention",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 2
      },
      "parentId": "shape:NrfEUK3ihwKQcQ7AYYYqI",
      "index": "a2lLU",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:5KEphEeY6obnOJORtPE1z": {
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1016,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:5KEphEeY6obnOJORtPE1z",
      "type": "gap",
      "parentId": "shape:m_JQs1vh7ev7ZFEm4X4p1",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "label": "Information is abundant and attention is the bottleneck.",
        "facingId": "shape:iuWyBjV_M67suiHyd0gqI",
        "sourceId": "g-r-009"
      },
      "index": "aF3Ez",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:uQU_YmtGpyijix8pNOwIn": {
      "x": 24,
      "y": 296,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:uQU_YmtGpyijix8pNOwIn",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "untyped",
        "text": "So I no longer ask how to protect my attention, as though guarding a balance, but what I am asking it to metabolize, and whether the diet I am feeding it—the feeds, the fragments, the endless untethered paragraphs—is a diet a practice can hold, and tend, rather than merely survive.",
        "sourceId": "010-the-stance",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 10
      },
      "parentId": "shape:OrypP3apbvLqca33-xLSd",
      "index": "a4BRM",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:1pPTBL6tHJIjbps9q9Zub": {
      "x": 24,
      "y": 24,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:1pPTBL6tHJIjbps9q9Zub",
      "type": "atom",
      "parentId": "shape:m_JQs1vh7ev7ZFEm4X4p1",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "stance",
        "text": "Attention is a resource, spent like currency, and the discipline of a life is mostly budgeting it.",
        "sourceId": "r-001",
        "created": "2026-07-31",
        "ordinal": 1
      },
      "index": "a1LnX",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:pa36m_ZsWZ4b7GtU8NjlW": {
      "x": 392,
      "y": 1016,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:pa36m_ZsWZ4b7GtU8NjlW",
      "type": "atom",
      "parentId": "shape:m_JQs1vh7ev7ZFEm4X4p1",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "stance",
        "text": "The cure for a distracted age is a stricter accounting.",
        "sourceId": "r-010",
        "created": "2026-07-31",
        "ordinal": 10
      },
      "index": "aAv3v",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "binding:z57oNhlWALZk3WiKzEK_T": {
      "meta": {},
      "id": "binding:z57oNhlWALZk3WiKzEK_T",
      "type": "arrow",
      "fromId": "shape:WU_bBTQIju5CXwp6oZf7H",
      "toId": "shape:Q6v7BwU_-f-xUqXudax6g",
      "props": {
        "isPrecise": false,
        "isExact": false,
        "normalizedAnchor": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "snap": "none",
        "terminal": "end"
      },
      "typeName": "binding"
    },
    "shape:5h56M-S2JwBpdmDcUTSaB": {
      "x": 392,
      "y": 296,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:5h56M-S2JwBpdmDcUTSaB",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "untyped",
        "text": "Under the spending view, rest is the only cure, and so we are told to unplug, to detox, to abstain—language borrowed wholesale from addiction, as though the mind were an account to be left alone until it refilled itself.",
        "sourceId": "011-borrowed-from-addiction",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 11
      },
      "parentId": "shape:OrypP3apbvLqca33-xLSd",
      "index": "a52tz",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "user:vq8nLR3ErvsQSb6j-dziI": {
      "name": "",
      "color": "#FF802B",
      "imageUrl": "",
      "meta": {},
      "id": "user:vq8nLR3ErvsQSb6j-dziI",
      "typeName": "user"
    },
    "shape:QGH-usEGnDcpVbKiO_hBq": {
      "x": 392,
      "y": 520,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:QGH-usEGnDcpVbKiO_hBq",
      "type": "gap",
      "parentId": "shape:m_JQs1vh7ev7ZFEm4X4p1",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "label": "Interruption is theft: every notification takes something that does not come back.",
        "facingId": "shape:k1y5NlA_IjtX9OOsqowkU",
        "sourceId": "g-r-006"
      },
      "index": "aCRnQ",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "binding:77KHPIJW7ChtC3Tl8uxmq": {
      "meta": {},
      "id": "binding:77KHPIJW7ChtC3Tl8uxmq",
      "type": "arrow",
      "fromId": "shape:DACF-SN196Abk8D_i1RYw",
      "toId": "shape:YkbTQeNKsOaCg8zIw08aE",
      "props": {
        "isPrecise": false,
        "isExact": false,
        "normalizedAnchor": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "snap": "none",
        "terminal": "start"
      },
      "typeName": "binding"
    },
    "shape:tJzGP1TYLRoG6ifY_Kf2e": {
      "x": 24,
      "y": 272,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:tJzGP1TYLRoG6ifY_Kf2e",
      "type": "atom",
      "parentId": "shape:qSBVHYUr_ji9QkO3ClHZd",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "claim",
        "text": "A wallet has one operation, subtraction. A gut has dozens, and none of them is a number going down.",
        "sourceId": "m-003",
        "created": "2026-07-31",
        "ordinal": 3
      },
      "index": "a3FNU",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    "shape:f79kIxp3mfh0cOk4RiolA": {
      "x": 392,
      "y": 48,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:f79kIxp3mfh0cOk4RiolA",
      "type": "atom",
      "props": {
        "w": 320,
        "h": 200,
        "atom": "figure",
        "text": "A wallet has one operation: subtraction. A gut has dozens—it selects, it ferments, it refuses, it stores, it converts one thing into another thing entirely, and none of this shows up as a number going down.",
        "sourceId": "008-what-digestion-does",
        "created": "2026-07-30",
        "ordinal": 8
      },
      "parentId": "shape:OrypP3apbvLqca33-xLSd",
      "index": "a21tv",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
